      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Pika H3 Flex \u2014 First & Last Frame (FL2VA, 6-Step)\n\nAnimate smoothly from **First Frame \u2192 Last Frame** (or **1-image Start-Only I2V** by unlinking `last_frame`) with synchronized stereo audio in **6 steps** (`lcm` + `ManualSigmas`, CFG 1.0).\n\n## Models (NOTE: FL2VA uses a separate diffusion model + LoRA from Ref2VA!)\n- **New downloads needed for FL2VA:**\n  - `models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` (~19.5 GB, [HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors))\n  - `models/loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors` ([HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors))\n- **Already shared with Ref2VA:**\n  - `models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n## Critical Rules\n- **Do NOT mix Ref2VA and FL2VA models/LoRAs** \u2014 `pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16` goes ONLY with `minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot`.\n- **Do NOT stack a Turbo/Lightning LoRA on top** \u2014 Pika H3 Flex is already distilled to 6 steps.\n- Keep **LoRA strength = `1.0`**, **sampler = `lcm`**, and **exact 7 `ManualSigmas` values**.\n- Requires **ComfyUI 0.44.0+** (100% native core nodes).\n\n## How to Use\n1. Load **First Frame** (`Picture 1`) and **Last Frame** (`Picture 2`).\n   - **Want 1-image Start-Only I2V?** Simply disconnect the `last_frame` wire on `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` (and mention only Picture 1 in the prompt).\n2. **Resolution (RTX 3090 24 GB):** Default is **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** for fast, safe tests. Raise `ResolutionSelector` to **`0.98 MP` (`1344\u00d7768`)** for full quality once you like the motion. Match your input images' aspect ratio.\n3. For spoken lines, add `(S1) ... <d>[English] Hello there.</d>` inside `integrated_multimodal_description`.\n4. **Last frame auto-saved** (`Pika_H3_Flex_FL2VA_last_frame_*.png`) for chaining into the next clip.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Pika H3 Flex \u2014 First & Last Frame (FL2VA, 6-Step)\n\nAnimate smoothly from **First Frame \u2192 Last Frame** (or **1-image Start-Only I2V** by unlinking `last_frame`) with synchronized stereo audio in **6 steps** (`lcm` + `ManualSigmas`, CFG 1.0).\n\n## Models (NOTE: FL2VA uses a separate diffusion model + LoRA from Ref2VA!)\n- **New downloads needed for FL2VA:**\n  - `models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` (~19.5 GB, [HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors))\n  - `models/loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors` ([HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors))\n- **Already shared with Ref2VA:**\n  - `models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n  - `models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n## Critical Rules\n- **Do NOT mix Ref2VA and FL2VA models/LoRAs** \u2014 `pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16` goes ONLY with `minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot`.\n- **Do NOT stack a Turbo/Lightning LoRA on top** \u2014 Pika H3 Flex is already distilled to 6 steps.\n- Keep **LoRA strength = `1.0`**, **sampler = `lcm`**, and **exact 7 `ManualSigmas` values**.\n- Requires **ComfyUI 0.44.0+** (100% native core nodes).\n\n## How to Use\n1. Load **First Frame** (`Picture 1`) and **Last Frame** (`Picture 2`).\n   - **Want 1-image Start-Only I2V?** Simply disconnect the `last_frame` wire on `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` (and mention only Picture 1 in the prompt).\n2. **Resolution (RTX 3090 24 GB):** Default is **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** for fast, safe tests. Raise `ResolutionSelector` to **`0.98 MP` (`1344\u00d7768`)** for full quality once you like the motion. Match your input images' aspect ratio.\n3. For spoken lines, add `(S1) ... <d>[English] Hello there.</d>` inside `integrated_multimodal_description`.\n4. **Last frame auto-saved** (`Pika_H3_Flex_FL2VA_last_frame_*.png`) for chaining into the next clip.\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Pika H3 Flex FL2VA (6-Step, 3090 / Spark)",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
